Chapter: DiffusionPixelForge
  cites Diffusion chapter ImageOut
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 io-pixel against Forge's own conversion of a decoded image to bytes
 (`modules/processing.py:1012-1013,1038-1039`), over the f32 inputs and bytes
 `build/pixel-oracle.py` prints: every byte boundary and three f32 values
 either side of it, the special values, and 256 uniform draws. The control is
 the rounding io-pixel did before it truncated as Forge does, which must
 disagree.

